# Optional — shared data folder for multiple workstations.
# Rename to data-path.txt and place next to CREW-Documents.exe.
# The first non-empty line (not starting with #) is used as the data path.
#
# Network share example:
# \\SERVER\share\CREW-data
#
# Local folder example (must contain crew-data.json):
# D:\CREW-data
